{% doc %}
  @prompt
    reate a premium Shopify section called "Results Statistics with Image".
    
    The section should have a clean, modern and premium design with a white background.
    
    Layout
    
    At the top, display an editable heading centred on the page.
    
    Below the heading, place three vertical statistics cards that sit partially over the top of a large image.
    
    The cards should appear to emerge naturally from the top edge of the image, creating a layered effect. The image should slightly overlap the bottom portion of the cards so the design feels connected rather than stacked.
    
    Below the cards, display one large editable image that spans almost the full width of the container.
    
    The image should have rounded corners and there should be no gaps between the cards and the image.
    
    The section should look luxurious and minimal.
    
    Statistics Cards
    
    Allow up to 4 statistics cards.
    
    Each card should contain:
    
    Large percentage or number
    Small supporting text underneath
    Custom background colour
    Custom number colour
    Custom text colour
    Adjustable border radius
    Adjustable internal padding
    
    Cards should be evenly spaced across desktop.
    
    Animation
    
    When the section scrolls into view:
    
    The statistics cards should animate upwards from inside the image, as though they are growing out from the top edge of the image.
    
    At the same time:
    
    Each card should smoothly increase its height from 0 to its final height.
    The percentage number should animate from 0 up to the configured value.
    The supporting text should fade in after the number animation finishes.
    The animation should only play once.
    
    Include controls for:
    
    Animation duration
    Delay between each card
    Enable or disable animations
    Image
    
    Provide an editable image picker.
    
    Allow:
    
    Desktop image
    Mobile image
    
    Image should support:
    
    Cover
    Contain
    
    Adjustable image height for desktop and mobile.
    
    Heading
    
    Allow editing of:
    
    Heading
    Font size
    Font weight
    Letter spacing
    Colour
    Alignment
    Optional Source Text
    
    Add an optional small text field aligned to the bottom right underneath the image.
    
    Example:
    
    "Source: Internal customer survey"
    
    Allow:
    
    Enable or disable
    Text
    Colour
    Font size
    Mobile Design
    
    The mobile version should automatically optimise itself.
    
    The statistics cards should become much narrower while keeping the same height proportions.
    
    Reduce horizontal spacing between cards.
    
    Cards should remain side by side and never overflow the screen.
    
    Reduce the font size of the numbers and supporting text automatically for smaller devices.
    
    The image should resize proportionally and maintain the overlapping effect.
    
    The overall layout should closely resemble the desktop version while remaining easy to read.
    
    Theme Editor Settings
    
    Include controls for:
    
    Section width
    Top and bottom padding
    Container width
    Background colour
    Heading
    Heading colour
    Heading size
    Desktop image
    Mobile image
    Image height desktop
    Image height mobile
    Card background colour
    Number colour
    Text colour
    Card border radius
    Card spacing
    Card width
    Card height
    Number font size
    Description font size
    Animation enable
    Animation speed
    Animation delay
    Source text
    Source text colour
    Source text size
    Technical Requirements
    Build using Shopify Liquid, HTML, CSS and vanilla JavaScript only.
    Do not use external libraries.
    All content must be editable from the Shopify Theme Editor.
    Optimise for performance.
    The section must be fully responsive and compatible with Online Store 2.0.
    Ensure animations are smooth using CSS transforms and requestAnimationFrame where appropriate.
    The counting animation should use an Intersection Observer so it only runs when the section enters the viewport.
    Structure the code cleanly with descriptive class names and avoid unnecessary repetition.
    
    This should feel like a premium wellness brand section inspired by high-end health and recovery websites, with polished animations and a seamless overlap between the statistic cards and the hero image., the bard need to start from the top part of the image and not interact with image, Make the bars' bottom part just in touch with the image's top part.
    
    Make the bars squared from bottom and top part only needs 2px radius, Give me an option to add subheading in the section as welll, Give me access to change the font size and font family everywhere. 
    
    Give me access to changethe thickness of the bars in mobile and computer seperately.
    
    Give me a button below the image with 4px as radius and keep it turned off by default., Make the image smaller in computer mode and also make sure that the whole image fits on the screen in mobile mode. , In contain mode of image, make sure that the bars still touch the top of the image, Please make sure that the image fits fully in mobile mode.
    Also ythe source detaiols are properly visible in mobile mode
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-results-stats-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px 0 {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-results-stats-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.container_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-results-stats-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.heading_alignment }};
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .ai-results-stats-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.heading_letter_spacing }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-results-stats-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.subheading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.subheading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subheading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.subheading_color }};
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-results-stats-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.image_max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-results-stats-cards-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_spacing }}px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-results-stat-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_bg_color }};
    border-radius: 2px 2px 0 0;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    width: {{ block.settings.card_width_desktop }}px;
    min-height: {{ block.settings.card_height_desktop }}px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    overflow: hidden;
    transform: translateY(0);
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .ai-results-stat-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-animate {
    transform: translateY(50px);
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .ai-results-stat-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.number_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.number_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.number_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.number_font_size }}px;
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .ai-results-stat-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.description_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.description_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.description_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .ai-results-stat-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-visible {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .ai-results-stats-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
  }

  .ai-results-stats-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: {{ block.settings.image_height_desktop }}px;
    object-fit: {{ block.settings.image_fit }};
    display: block;
    {% if block.settings.image_fit == 'contain' %}
      object-position: top center;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-results-stats-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: {{ block.settings.image_height_desktop }}px;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-results-stats-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 500px;
    max-height: 500px;
  }

  .ai-results-stats-button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .ai-results-stats-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.button_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.button_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    border: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-results-stats-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-results-stats-source-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: right;
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.source_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.source_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.source_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.source_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.source_color }};
    opacity: 0.7;
    padding: 0 4px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-results-stats-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 12px;
    }

    .ai-results-stats-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .ai-results-stats-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .ai-results-stats-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-results-stats-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size_mobile }}px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .ai-results-stats-cards-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: {{ block.settings.card_spacing | times: 0.5 }}px;
      padding: 0 8px;
    }

    .ai-results-stat-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.card_width_mobile }}px;
      min-width: 90px;
      max-width: 140px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding | times: 0.7 }}px {{ block.settings.card_padding | times: 0.5 }}px;
      min-height: {{ block.settings.card_height_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-results-stat-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.number_font_size_mobile }}px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .ai-results-stat-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-results-stats-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius | times: 0.75 }}px;
    }

    .ai-results-stats-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: auto;
      max-height: {{ block.settings.image_height_mobile }}px;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
    }

    .ai-results-stats-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: auto;
      min-height: 250px;
      max-height: {{ block.settings.image_height_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-results-stats-button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .ai-results-stats-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size_mobile }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical | times: 0.875 }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal | times: 0.875 }}px;
    }

    .ai-results-stats-source-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.source_font_size_mobile }}px;
      margin-top: 12px;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0 8px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<results-statistics-{{ ai_gen_id }}
  class="ai-results-stats-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  data-animation-enabled="{{ block.settings.enable_animation }}"
  data-animation-duration="{{ block.settings.animation_duration }}"
  data-animation-delay="{{ block.settings.animation_delay }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="ai-results-stats-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank or block.settings.subheading != blank %}
      <div class="ai-results-stats-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-results-stats-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.subheading != blank %}
          <div class="ai-results-stats-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subheading }}</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-results-stats-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-results-stats-cards-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% for i in (1..4) %}
          {% liquid
            assign card_enabled_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_enabled'
            assign card_number_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_number'
            assign card_suffix_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_suffix'
            assign card_description_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_description'
            assign card_bg_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_bg_color'
            assign card_number_color_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_number_color'
            assign card_text_color_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_text_color'

            assign card_enabled = block.settings[card_enabled_key]
            assign card_number = block.settings[card_number_key]
            assign card_suffix = block.settings[card_suffix_key]
            assign card_description = block.settings[card_description_key]
            assign card_bg = block.settings[card_bg_key]
            assign card_number_color = block.settings[card_number_color_key]
            assign card_text_color = block.settings[card_text_color_key]
          %}

          {% if card_enabled %}
            <div
              class="ai-results-stat-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if block.settings.enable_animation %}ai-animate{% endif %}"
              data-card-index="{{ i }}"
              data-target-number="{{ card_number }}"
              style="
                background-color: {{ card_bg }};
              "
            >
              <div
                class="ai-results-stat-number-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                style="color: {{ card_number_color }};"
                data-number-element
              >
                0{{ card_suffix }}
              </div>
              <div
                class="ai-results-stat-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% unless block.settings.enable_animation %}ai-visible{% endunless %}"
                style="color: {{ card_text_color }};"
                data-description-element
              >
                {{ card_description }}
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-results-stats-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.image_desktop %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.image_desktop | image_url: width: 2000 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.alt | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.width }}"
            height="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.height }}"
            class="ai-results-stats-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            srcset="{{ block.settings.image_desktop | image_url: width: 375 }} 375w,
                    {{ block.settings.image_desktop | image_url: width: 750 }} 750w,
                    {{ block.settings.image_desktop | image_url: width: 1100 }} 1100w,
                    {{ block.settings.image_desktop | image_url: width: 1500 }} 1500w,
                    {{ block.settings.image_desktop | image_url: width: 2000 }} 2000w"
            sizes="(min-width: 750px) calc(100vw - 40px), calc(100vw - 24px)"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-results-stats-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'lifestyle-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      {% if block.settings.show_button and block.settings.button_text != blank %}
        <div class="ai-results-stats-button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <a href="{{ block.settings.button_link }}" class="ai-results-stats-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.button_text }}
          </a>
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.show_source and block.settings.source_text != blank %}
        <div class="ai-results-stats-source-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.source_text }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</results-statistics-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class ResultsStatistics{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.animationEnabled = this.dataset.animationEnabled === 'true';
        this.animationDuration = parseFloat(this.dataset.animationDuration) * 1000;
        this.animationDelay = parseFloat(this.dataset.animationDelay) * 1000;
        this.hasAnimated = false;
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        if (this.animationEnabled) {
          this.setupIntersectionObserver();
        }
      }

      setupIntersectionObserver() {
        const options = {
          root: null,
          rootMargin: '0px',
          threshold: 0.2
        };

        this.observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
          entries.forEach(entry => {
            if (entry.isIntersecting && !this.hasAnimated) {
              this.hasAnimated = true;
              this.animateCards();
              this.observer.disconnect();
            }
          });
        }, options);

        this.observer.observe(this);
      }

      animateCards() {
        const cards = this.querySelectorAll('.ai-results-stat-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        
        cards.forEach((card, index) => {
          setTimeout(() => {
            this.animateCard(card);
          }, index * this.animationDelay);
        });
      }

      animateCard(card) {
        const targetNumber = parseInt(card.dataset.targetNumber);
        const numberElement = card.querySelector('[data-number-element]');
        const descriptionElement = card.querySelector('[data-description-element]');
        const suffix = numberElement.textContent.replace(/[0-9]/g, '');

        card.style.transition = `transform ${this.animationDuration}ms cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), 
                                 opacity ${this.animationDuration}ms ease`;
        
        requestAnimationFrame(() => {
          card.classList.remove('ai-animate');
        });

        const countDuration = this.animationDuration * 0.8;
        const startTime = performance.now();

        const animateCount = (currentTime) => {
          const elapsed = currentTime - startTime;
          const progress = Math.min(elapsed / countDuration, 1);
          
          const easeOutQuart = 1 - Math.pow(1 - progress, 4);
          const currentNumber = Math.floor(easeOutQuart * targetNumber);
          
          numberElement.textContent = currentNumber + suffix;

          if (progress < 1) {
            requestAnimationFrame(animateCount);
          } else {
            numberElement.textContent = targetNumber + suffix;
            
            if (descriptionElement) {
              descriptionElement.style.transition = 'opacity 400ms ease';
              descriptionElement.classList.add('ai-visible');
            }
          }
        };

        setTimeout(() => {
          requestAnimationFrame(animateCount);
        }, this.animationDuration * 0.3);
      }
    }

    customElements.define('results-statistics-{{ ai_gen_id }}', ResultsStatistics{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Results statistics",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "container_width",
